      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "\u003Ch1\u003EEt nemo nimium beatus est;\u003C/h1\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELorem ipsum dolor sit amet, \u003Cem\u003Econsectetur adipiscing elit\u003C/em\u003E. Bork Si qua in iis corrigere voluit, deteriora fecit.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPraeclare Laelius, et recte sof\u00F1w, illudque vere: O Publi, o gurges, Galloni! es homo miser, inquit.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EVidit Homerus probari fabulam non posse, si cantiunculis tantus irretitus vir teneretur;\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ESed tamen intellego quid velit.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003ENec vero sum nescius esse utilitatem in historia, non modo voluptatem.\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoc tu nunc in illo probas. \u003Cstrong\u003EDuo Reges:\u003C/strong\u003E constructio interrete. Bork Contineo me ab exemplis. Confecta res esset. Quid iudicant sensus?\u00A0\u003Ca rel=\u0022noopener\u0022 href=\u0022https://google.com/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EQuid de Platone aut de Democrito loquar?\u003C/a\u003E\u00A0Quodsi ipsam honestatem undique pertectam atque absolutam.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EDicimus aliquem hilare vivere;\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EIntrandum est igitur in rerum naturam et penitus quid ea postulet pervidendum;\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EErgo hoc quidem apparet, nos ad agendum esse natos.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EConferam tecum, quam cuique verso rem subicias;\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E",
  "blocks": {
